# Temple of Plenty enters tapped (its first sentence) and, when it enters, scry 1 (CR 701.22): Bot1 sends the Lightning Bolt it
# looks at to the bottom, so the Black Lotus under it is on top and Counterspell next, with every card still in the
# library (scry is not surveil: none goes to the graveyard). On turn 3, untapped, its {T} adds exactly one green mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Temple of Plenty
Island x6
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Temple of Plenty.Play
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Library = Black Lotus; Counterspell; Lightning Bolt
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0

[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Temple of Plenty.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Temple of Plenty
Bot1.Battlefield.Temple of Plenty.Tapped = true
